<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Santander ups Argentine telecoms.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Santander ups Argentine telecoms.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Santander Investment said it upgraded the shares of Argentina's Telecom and Telefnica to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;market perform.&quot;</p>
<p>- The upgrade came as a result of a tariff restructuring announced Thursday, reducing long-distance rates and hiking residential phone rentals.</p>
</text>
